# Extended-regex patterns that must never appear in unity.log during smoke.
# One pattern per line; blank lines and # comments ignored.
# Used by run_smoketest.sh (hard fail) and triage_run.sh (report counts).
#
# Prefer fixing the source over removing a pattern. These are not "noise" —
# they are client/server authority mistakes that previously slipped past the
# exception-only unity.log gate (FishNet LogWarning, not Exception:).

Cannot complete operation as server when server is not active

# FishNet kicks a client whose ServerRpc throws on the server (2026-11-02: muzzle flash built a
# Material on the shaderless dedicated server). The player gets a hard disconnect.
will be kicked immediately
